Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:34.82,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,NewTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:39.12,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Every minute, it sees hundreds \Nof hours of video uploaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:42.37,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,as well as hundreds of thousands \Nof hours of video watched,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:45.23,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,making it the world's most-visited website.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:51.63,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1020)\pos(300,10)}Katsudon: It's almost time\Nohashi: gg masakichi\NHibiscus: Are you two okay?\NDon't push yourselves\NChachamaru: Hellooo\Nnemo: hey\Nkkkk0302: yo losers\Nimhungry: Masakichi's done for!\NMasakichi's done for!\NMasakichi's done for!\NIshibashi T. Wataru: Man up and step down\NGakkey: What happened?\NSparkling * Chondroitin: kikka a cute\NLonely Oedo Girl: Think about how the fans feel.\NHow about I punch you too??\Nlol lmao: apology stream yessssss\NVitamin B2: Unforgivable\NKai10: Are you two okay...?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,These comments, I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:51.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1232,1020)\an7\c&HFFEFFE&\3c&H56344C&\bord2.5\pos(30,10)}Hype-Sis\NUrgent Announcement
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.69,0:01:50.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Utter trash.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.52,0:01:52.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}they{\i0} know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:57.72,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,To all of you who continue to \Nsupport us, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:01.13,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,Today, we have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:04.42,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,First, regarding the past several videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:08.78,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,we would like to apologize for \Nany discomfort they may have caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:14.12,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,To set things right, we've decided \Nto let Masakichi go as a member.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:17.78,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,She's been making videos with us \Nsince high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.53,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,so we wanted to keep her on if possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:25.29,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(232.5,17)}Breaking: Masakichi fired\NFifth Champion Tanaka: The latest videos were awful.\NAre you two okay?\NIt's me, Hana: Masakichi's out, huh? Makes sense\NAvocado: No one likes Masakichi anyway, so who cares?\Npui: lol fired lmao\NBlack-Hearted Kurosuke: The videos were hard to watch.\NI sincerely hope this leads to the best for all three of you.\NAntinomy: Masakichi ruins the videos. I hate seeing her.\Nsmooth finish: show her face already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:25.29,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,but the truth is that we haven't been \Non good terms for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.86,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,From frustration about not getting views,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:29.74,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,to complaints about the content of our videos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:31.41,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,and differences in enthusiasm levels...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:33.17,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,We had our fair share of arguments,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:37.42,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,followed by her violent outburst \Nthe other day during our livestream...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:38.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:40.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's all {\i1}my{\i0} fault now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:43.12,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,...and the toxic posts \Ndiscovered on her alt after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:51.02,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(402,517)\c&H433F47&\pos(276,13.5)}stinger{\c&H8D908D&} @chikchik_m3k\NShe wasn't the one I punched, so what's her deal?\NStop playing the victim... So annoying\N\N{\c&H433F47&}stinger{\c&H8D908D&} @chikchik_m3k\NYou seriously can't even do this? So useless\N\N{\c&H433F47&}stinger{\c&H8D908D&} @chikchik_m3k\NGod they're so needy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:48.77,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,We want everyone to enjoy watching \Nthe Hyped-Up Sisters channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:51.06,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,so we can't overlook these actions \Nfrom one of our members.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:03:01.20,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1277,1)\move(300,70.5,300,-56.5,1318,3445)\clip(282.5,56,621,279)}Re: She crossed the line there\NJO: true lol\NI quit: Bye masakichi\NYasu: Yeah figures\Napple: so long\NWrinkled dress shirt: well duh\Njiji: Right move\NLonely Oedo Girl: Eat ittttttttttttttt\Nhuman: violent bitch die die die die die\Nedamame: i hope you never change otomin\Nky: Cut it out already\NIburi Gakko Enthusiast: I know it won't be easy\Ngoing forward, but I'm rooting for you!\Ngun666: Show yourself, Masakichi\NEye Drops: Go away loser\Nbom777: ggwp\NMa: Why are you two apologizing?\Ntasteless odorless: You might be better off\Ngoing your separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:57.52,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:03:00.60,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,After getting together as a group to \Ndiscuss these incidents and our next steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.49,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,The haters are the ones to blame here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:00.89,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,I did nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:05.28,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,the two of us and Masakichi \Nhave decided to go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:08.90,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,If all of you watching \Ncan find it to forgive us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:08.90,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:14.29,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,we would like to continue Hype-Sis with \Njust the two of us, Otomin and Kicchomu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:13.34,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're the ones who made that decision for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.22,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We would like to take this \Nopportunity to make a fresh start,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:23.05,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,and focus on diligently making videos \Nthat all of our viewers can enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.30,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,As the new and reborn Hyped-Up Sisters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.93,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,we'll do our best to hit the goal Masakichi had set
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:32.66,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,of reaching one million channel subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:36.72,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Finally, please continue to support us—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:43.07,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(327,7.5)\3c&H5A2A04&}The Canceled Girl and the Sleepy Vampire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:46.08,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\bord2.5\fnArial Black\3c&HB198F9&\frz4.13\fax0.03\move(217.5,32,7.02,21.69,27,2989)}One Moment, Please
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.93,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Now you've made another mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.93,0:03:48.45,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,That's a lot of comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:52.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, looks like you racked up a ton of hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:54.66,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Also, a million subs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:03:59.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:01.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No one will stick around once I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:02.74,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We won't let them slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.22,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We'll keep growing our numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:08.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who came up \Nwith all our video ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:10.84,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,You just wanted to call all the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I was the one who filmed and edited—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.17,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,We'll do what we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:17.56,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Besides, it'll be smooth sailing \Nif we hire someone new!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.44,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We're going to start the stream again. \NWill you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:25.38,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Well, not like anyone wants \Nto see a violent bitch like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:31.22,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, there! Masakichi here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.96,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've decided to start a solo channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:38.88,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,This channel will be for videos of \Nall the things I really wanted to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The comments are a war zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:40.96,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(241,92.5,241,-32.5,25,2986)\clip(164.5,87.5,640,220.5)}tommy: Have you ever considered how\Nthe two Hype-Sis members must feel?\NShushusuke: I had to stop watching after the first minute\NTangerine Jelly: Please don't upload any more videos\Nyamamomo: Are you really taking this attitude\Nafter punching someone? You can't just pretend it\Ndidn't happen, so please apologize to the other two\Nand give us fans a proper explanation.\Nmerorin: why the hell would you start a solo channel\NMilk Tea: All she thinks about is herself.\NShe doesn't care at all how the fans feel.\NSE: A 10 min video yapping about herself\Nand zero apologies lmao\Notooto: The stuff about recent gripes is w/e,\Nbut I can't forgive you for punching Otomin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll get everyone talking \Nand blow those two out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:43.60,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,All the ideas that wouldn't have \Nflown before are fair game now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.47,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,118.5)}Rice: she doesn't regret anything she did\Naa: So this is what Masakichi is really like..\Ntomtom: Seriously messed up as a person\NShrimp: Think about the other two a little\Namebaaaaaaaa: Nice sockpuppet\Nsdsjkfha: Please. Just quit already.\NThe Great Acorn: Turns out Masakichi's\N willing to do whatever it takes\N for her own success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:47.47,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Please support the channel, \Nlike, and subscribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:49.98,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is your chance to witness a legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:55.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not even one positive comment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:01.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Damage control, damage control!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b0\frz16.86\c&H575A57&\pos(126,197)}Masakichi-san, {\alpha&HFF&}I'm a huge fan of yours!
