Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:57.01,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:06:59.29,Default,Live,0,0,0,,My hand! My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:04.88,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.88,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Pipe down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.73,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:10.15,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:19.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You almost turned me to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't open the curtains in a vampire's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:25.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I forgot to close them after cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:28.75,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,More importantly, I'm happy \Nto see you're finally awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:29.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm going back to sleep, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:34.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Back to my dream to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:39.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I've been worried sick these last twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.35,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Did you say twenty years?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.60,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It was a royal pain watching\N you sleep this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:50.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,If I was sleeping for twenty years, \Nwhy'd I get interrupted at the best part?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:54.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I will say, you really {\i1}are{\i0} \Nmy savior, Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:56.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? Your savior?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.74,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&HF26C65&\shad2\4a&H66&}Thud!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.74,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:03.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What're all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.17,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\bord2\fs20\fnArial Black\c&H2E28BC&\3c&H84C5D3&\pos(78,43.5)}Pay us back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.17,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\bord2\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\c&H593BB0&\3c&HD5CC8E&\pos(79,158)}Collection Letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.17,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\bord2\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\c&H2D1ED1&\3c&H57D9CA&\pos(291.5,262.5)}Collection Letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.17,Signs_Boxed,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\fs15\fnTimes New Roman\c&HC4C8C8&\bord4\3c&H8BC3D0&\pos(524.5,57.5)}Pay  {\fnArial\c&H222926&}back   {\fnArial Black\c&HD0CFCF&}what  {\fnVerdana\c&H393C3C&}you  {\fnGeorgia\c&H232B28&}owe
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.16,0:08:07.17,Signs_Boxed,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,226)\fs15\fnTimes New Roman\c&HC4C8C8&\3c&H84807F&\bord1\pos(524.5,57.5)}Pay{\bord0}  {\fnArial\c&H222926&\3c&HCACFCF&\bord1}back{\bord0}   {\fnArial Black\c&HD0CFCF&\3c&H595E5E&\bord1}what{\bord0}  {\fnVerdana\c&H393C3C&\3c&H9EA0A1&\bord1}you{\bord0}  {\fnGeorgia\c&H232B28&\3c&H7A7F7B&\bord1}owe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.21,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Collation letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,{\i1}Collection{\i0} letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:11.99,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I've been working my butt off to look after \NBanpai Manor these past twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:14.69,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,But the debt just keeps piling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:16.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, debt? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:19.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I started trading stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.85,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What? {\i1}You{\i0} of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:21.64,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:24.29,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I invested all over. Futures trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.98,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm staying ahead of the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,How can someone who can't read \Nthe word "collection" even trade stocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:35.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I consulted videos from \Nstock market experts, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.37,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,They promised I'd rake in the cash \Nif I did as they said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.37,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs14\3c&H405F23&\pos(187.5,71.5)}Save up ¥10 million\N{\c&H311EC9&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs16}Investing in Stocks\N{\c&H4AF1E9&\3c&H405F23&\fs14}Tips & Tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.37,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs22\c&H571CC6&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(187.5,166.5)}Stocks\N{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H9D3944&\fs14}Guaranteed not to fail
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.37,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs14\pos(187.5,268)\bord1}The Hype-Sis Scandal\Nin 3 Minutes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:39.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Videos?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What's this rectangular slab?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:43.83,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's called a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.24,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\3c&H95989B&\pos(497,132)}The Hype-Sis Scandal\Nin 3 Minutes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}this{\i0} is a wild turn of events!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.47,0:09:02.47,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs28\bord3\fnTimes New Roman\an9\c&H2E3537&\3c&HD3DCDD&}Rental Space\N\N{\fs20}Masakichi Channel\NNew Member Auditions\N\N{\fs22}Conference Room B
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thank you for your application.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.23,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs9\c&H393138&\3c&HD5D6D3&\fax0.85\fscx80\frz46.4\pos(231,107.5)}Masakichi New Channel\N\h\h\h\h\hMember Interviews
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.26,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:08.48,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,Without further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:14.21,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,I snuck into an interview for the disgraced \NNewTuber Masakichi's new member auditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.40,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,No lies. I'm really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:16.94,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:21.36,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,But man, right before me \Nis Little Miss Canceled herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:24.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, if you were to join as a member...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:26.37,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not here to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:29.38,Default,Mob A,0,0,0,,Hey, do you mind if I upload \Nthis video to my channel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:30.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:32.69,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.51,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,He looks a lot more serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, if you were to join as a member...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:39.14,Default,Mob B,0,0,0,,Ah, could I ask you a question first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:41.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:45.74,Default,Mob B,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you'd like to say \Nto the two current members of Hype-Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:46.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, um... Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.50,Default,Mob B,0,0,0,,You must be angry, having to leave by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.11,Default,Mob B,0,0,0,,They were bad-mouthing you \Non yesterday's stream, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.86,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Those jerks...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean, in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is that thing recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:11.46,Default,Mob C,0,0,0,,My little brother is very ill, \Nand he's a fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:14.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then why don't we...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(355,1)\bord3\fnArial Black\c&H373A37&\3c&H77CFEB&\frz-8.4\pos(334.5,192.5)}You Got {\c&H4A449F&}Pranked
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.14,Default,Mob C,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:15.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:23.31,Default,Mob D,0,0,0,,Please! Let me taste that punch of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:28.19,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,We're here to celebrate \Nour third day as a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.19,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.52,Default,Salesman,0,0,0,,Find happiness with these products!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:30.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A mascot suit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:32.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.25,Default,Drunk,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.01,Default,Drunk,0,0,0,,All right, time to come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Guess it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:47.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The only people who would come are trolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.67,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs13\c&H4B4B4B&\3c&HFAFEFB&}Miyama VS Hirata{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @miyamavshirata\NLooks like all she cares about is getting hits.\NSo desperate for attention, it makes me sick.\N\N{\c&H4B4B4B&}HSHS{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @HSHSHSHS\Nno one's gonna join your\Nawful despotic channel lmao\N\N{\c&H4B4B4B&}runrunboy{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @runrunboy\NI'm a veteran Hype-Sis fan, and the videos\NMasakichi planned have way less hits.\NNow I realize her personality must be\Nwhy she can't come up with any decent ideas.\N\N{\c&H4B4B4B&}Hot Chili Pepper{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @hotchilipepper\NThe nerve to punch someone, never apologize,\Nand now recruit new members. Zero common sense.\N\N{\c&H4B4B4B&}shuu{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @shuu27\Nmaybe i should go laugh at her.\Nand expose her as a disgrace.\N\N{\c&H4B4B4B&}1234go{\c&H9D9D9D&}  @1234go\NWhy don't you start by saying sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:57.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go get a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(72,1)\bord2\fs14\an7\c&H4B4B4B&\3c&HFAFEFB&\pos(328.5,117)}You have a message from Live.\N{\c&H9D9D9D&}We've been brought together by fate.\NMy heart races thinking about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:05.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, this is amazing! And convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can do anything on this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:12.19,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama, you drank all of our blood rations?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:13.62,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I haven't had blood in twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:18.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Now then, did she reply to my DM?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:19.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Nothing yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.92,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I haven't had a drop to drink today...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Can you believe it, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:27.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,The girl from my dream exists in real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:29.71,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So her name's Masakichi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:29.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(23,2359,\fscx105.63\fscy105.63)\fs16\bord1.5\fnArial Black\3c&H95989B&\frz351.8\move(337.5,209,338.55,210.33,23,2359)}The Hype-Sis Scandal in 3 Minutes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:30.73,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:31.98,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Was it a prophetic dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.58,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Did I have that power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:35.36,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I'm totally unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.22,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama is lost in her thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:41.48,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,She must be coming up \Nwith a way to pay off my debts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.64,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I love you, Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.34,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't wait to suck \NMasakichi-chan's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:46.62,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Just slurp it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.93,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,She's racking her brains, all for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:52.94,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Could Live-sama be in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.79,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,Hey! Give us our money!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.37,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Fear not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.90,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone \Ndisturb Live-sama's thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.02,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I can't just go in for a big bite, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:04.09,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,We need to get to know each other first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:06.28,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,But can I really hold myself back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.66,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I guess we should start with greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.91,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, but we've already met in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:11.69,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:15.24,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Could it be that I've shown up \Nin her dreams, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:15.74,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:19.31,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:21.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.81,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.81,Default,Collector,0,0,0,,Damn it, where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:33.44,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I can't cause trouble for Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.65,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.86,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,What the hell? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:44.32,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm so low on blood, \NI can't even lift a finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:45.74,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.74,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:53.00,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(27,5240,\fscx129.87\fscy129.87)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H58EDF4&\4c&H488BCE&\shad1.5\frx-30\frz344.8\move(479.5,150.5,522.23,67.25,27,5240)}Wahhh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:51.76,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're going to burn me alive and\N turn me into smoked meat, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:53.00,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.86,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I pair well with anything except garlic chips!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.08,Default,Collector A,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:06.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ah, Live-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:12.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You came to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:16.83,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Miss! Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:19.18,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:23.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Another shochu on the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.45,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,We're about to close for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:33.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You know, {\i1}I{\i0} was the one who suggested \Nthe three of us start making videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.85,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:37.06,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Look, we're closing—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:37.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why am {\i1}I{\i0} the one getting kicked out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.21,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Ma'am, we're closing—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I heard you the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Also, the auditions today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.51,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:52.85,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,You're Masakichi-san from \NHyped-Up Sisters, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:56.09,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Don't start causing trouble \Nfor people in real life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:58.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell's {\i1}her{\i0} deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:06.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All anyone does is try and kick me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:09.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's people like them \Nshitposting in my replies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:15.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm totally wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:19.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But there's no way \NI'm going back to that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:26.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,An abandoned hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:29.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Haunted spots...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:34.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The first video of ours that went viral...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.40,FlashbackItalics,Group,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.58,FlashbackItalics,Group,0,0,0,,Today on Hype-Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.93,FlashbackItalics,Group,0,0,0,,We're visiting an abandoned hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:41.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H76F4F6&\3c&H024BEF&}Visiting an abandoned hospital!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.98,FlashbackItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's right! We received \Nspecial permission for today
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:49.46,FlashbackItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,to shoot a video at the abandoned \Nhospital that's said to be haunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:53.41,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(942,518)\fs30\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H76F4F6&\3c&H024BEF&}Thank you for giving us permission!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:52.41,FlashbackItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go ahead and take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:58.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Masakichi Channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:01.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm here at an abandoned hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:05.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,...tal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,S-So empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:09.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:11.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I just need to get a viral video.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:14.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,C'mon! I can take on any ghosts or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's too dark to see very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:28.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now then, where's our ghost—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So cold! Where'd that water come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:33.71,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Gross. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:45.47,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.33,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, I see something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:53.46,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,What? A real ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.41,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:55.58,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,Huh? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.87,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,Nah, that's just a reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:00.33,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's hurry up and go further in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.40,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.61,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:05.77,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can't you act a little more \Nscared for the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.70,FlashbackTop,Group,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:14.38,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:19.48,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I just wanted to have fun and get \Nlots of people to watch our videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:22.04,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's the reason I worked so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.76,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,But it's all gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:30.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can't believe Ichiko let \Nour blood supply run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:33.47,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Of course I'm the one who drank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:37.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why isn't there any blood in this hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait, why's this place so empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:40.25,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And dark, to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:45.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Must have closed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:47.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This place was packed twenty years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:53.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:56.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I just caught a whiff of \Nsome really tasty blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, man, no way! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:03.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,My entire body's about to go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.47,Default,Live,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you're Masakichi-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:25.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:26.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm... Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:34.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,U-Um, could it be that you've been \Ndreaming about me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:37.36,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What kind of question is {\i0}that?!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Have you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.05,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.87,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I need to say something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:46.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,D-Do you mind if I use the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:49.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ugh, I love your voice, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:50.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm about to lose all control!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:54.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.43,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I... want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nope, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:03.96,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.56,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:07.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:10.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,First, let's get to know each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's gonna get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't change directions so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:21.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Something's obviously weird about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is she...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:24.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Could she be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:26.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let me suck your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:29.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She's got to be a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? Spaciu—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's a cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:50.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you come any closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:52.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:54.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Once you're gone, I'll come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:55.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:56.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just one bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:58.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You can spare just one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.09,0:19:00.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't say it like you're bumming a cig!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:02.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What in the world {\i1}are{\i0} you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:03.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, so come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:04.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:09.83,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:13.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You know, I saw this video...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:13.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\bord1.5\fnArial Black\3c&H95989B&\fax-0.05\frz358.6\move(301,256,308,250,29,1113)}The Hype-Sis Scandal in 3 Minutes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:15.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:19.38,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,Besides, it'll be smooth sailing \Nif we hire someone new!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:17.91,FlashbackTop,Mob A,0,0,0,,Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.91,0:19:19.91,FlashbackTop,Waitress,0,0,0,,Don't start causing trouble \Nfor people in real life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:21.63,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,Not like anyone wants to see \Na violent bitch like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:24.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't care about any of that anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:27.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:31.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No one... needs me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:39.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I've hit the jackpot with your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:42.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's legit one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.24,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:50.58,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:53.85,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:55.85,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm so tired, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:19:58.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:08.51,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I {\i1}told{\i0} you it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:20.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:22.65,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Being caught's not so bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:25.16,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.16,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is out of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:46.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:05.78,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H437631&\3c&H481B2B&\bord3\move(632,20,-1200,20)}Baaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:07.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.11,0:21:12.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, that was a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You want my blood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:17.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Star in my videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:32.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you do, I can make videos \Nthat no one's seen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:36.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I bet I could reach a million \Nsubscribers in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:37.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:38.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I want you to join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:47.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In exchange, once we hit a million subs...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:50.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Make a meal of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Live\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFEEFFA&\3c&HDFAAB5&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:26.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:26.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.69,0:23:27.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.21,0:23:28.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll make a vampire channel like none other!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:29.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:31.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll show those two jerks what's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:30.22,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&HA2373B&\3c&HF4A0D5&\blur1\frz-14.68\pos(89,16.5)}Jerk #1
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:30.22,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H46D1EC&\3c&H5164B6&\blur1\frz14.25\pos(573,144.5)}Jerk #2
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,By the way, what's a "channel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.40,0:23:32.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:33.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.22,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For real, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:37.47,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Starting a Channel! \NGood Morning from the Dead of Night!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:37.47,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2D4146&}Starting a Channel!\NGood Morning from the Dead of Night!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Make sure you hit that like and subscribe!
